# Local Worker secrets for `wrangler dev` / `opennextjs-cloudflare preview`.
# Copy to .dev.vars (git-ignored). The app needs none: the database is the
# HYPERDRIVE binding, the images the IMAGES bucket, the search cache the
# CACHE namespace (all in wrangler.jsonc, local under `wrangler dev`), and
# both models Workers AI's, through the AI binding — which reaches your
# Cloudflare account after `wrangler login`.
